></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_HarperLedger</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_HarperLedger\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_SCL_ServantOfTheRaven_HarperLedger\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">c2e4b6e3-5d33-4cdf-afc0-5b583a1aabf0</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c2e4b6e3-5d33-4cdf-afc0-5b583a1aabf0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c2e4b6e3-5d33-4cdf-afc0-5b583a1aabf0\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Beneath the floorboards in the <a href=\"/wiki/Waning_Moon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Waning Moon\">Waning Moon</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-224&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-77</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[The words 'For the Attention of <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Justiciar\" title=\"Dark Justiciar\">Dark Justiciar</a> Netasha' are written across the top of every page. This is an excerpt from the last page.]\n</p><p>Morning, day fifteen: Szymon Nowak. Said <a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\">Ketheric</a> wouldn't \"hold onto <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a> for long at this rate.\"\n</p><p><br>\nEvening, day eighteen: Imanni Aatakni. Claimed it was unfair that the <a href=\"/wiki/Thorm\" title=\"Thorm\">Thorms</a> had \"the cushiest jobs.\"\n</p><p><br>\nNight, day twenty-two: Marc Jacobs. Benjamin Blanchet. Made jokes about the Thorms, especially Lord Ketheric. Said he was a \"misery guts\", a \"weeping nutsack\", and discussed exactly how his wife would have \"liked it.\"\n</p><p>I know what Marc and Ben said was just plain awful, Lady Netasha, but they're some of my best friends, and I've never heard such talk out of them. They were upset over their wages being cut, and were the drunkest I'd ever seen by midnight. I know it looks bad, but hand over heart, you've never met two gents more devoted to our Lady – I swear it.\n</p><p><br>\n[A different, more elegant script appears beneath it.]\n</p><p><br>\nOur <a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\">Lady of Loss</a> would be proud of you, Madeline. Do not worry about Marc and Benjamin. Myself, and your two 'gents' are simply going to have a little chat. I promise.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195048\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.061 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.068 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1870/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 36691/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12851/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935420/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion ti